/-!
# Static spherical metrics: jets of the metric entries

For `ds² = -f(r) dt² + dr²/f(r) + r² dΩ²`: the entries `g00 = -f`, `g11 = 1/f`, `g22 = r²`, `g33 = r² sin²θ` as
functions of `(r, θ)` with their partial derivatives up to order two, written with the atoms `f0 = f`, `f1 = f'`, `f2 = f''`
(`ssg…`, generated by a script; each the verified derivative of the previous one, `hdSS_…`), and the formulas for `pd`
(`pd_ssg…`) feeding `Regge.Conv3.riemann_jet` in `StaticSphericalRicci`.

Gap row G3-022, supporting file.
-/

open Matrix Real

noncomputable section

namespace Lightlike

